          "description": "Tender Tales explore the everyday indignities, scenarios, and emotions that children experience. From a boy who drops his ice cream cone, to a child who doesn't want to go to school,  to a boy who doesn't want to turn off his Yoto, I hope that your child sees a piece of themselves—human, resilient, deserving of empathy and grace—in these stories. If your child enjoys these stories, learn more about Tender Tales in Yoto Space.",
